00:17:33,930 --> 00:17:37,140
我还喜欢你从来不说脏话
I also love how you never use swear words.

312
00:17:37,310 --> 00:17:38,440
但事实上
You know, it turns out,

313
00:17:38,770 --> 00:17:41,690
骂人不吐脏字  照样杀人于无形
you can hurt people just as well without 'em.

314
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:47,530
谁有空过来帮忙把这些东西收好
Maybe I can get a little help putting some of this stuff away.

315
00:17:47,740 --> 00:17:49,610
别激动
Oh, calm down.

316
00:17:49,780 --> 00:17:51,620
我不是才把五杯这个"收进"肚里吗
I already put away five of these!

317
00:17:53,580 --> 00:17:57,040
你看吧  轻松堵上她嘴  不用一个脏字
You see? No muss, no fuss, not a single cuss.

